$ 26016 v20 - WinGRAF ULS envelope pictures for the report appendix (generated by scripts/make_wing.py)
$ Reads 26016_env_v20.cdb = COPY of 26016_check_v20.cdb. Envelope LCs from the model's own MAXIMA COMB 3:
$ 4321/4322 N, 4323/4324 Vy, 4325/4326 Vz, 4327/4328 Mt, 4329/4330 My, 4331/4332 Mz (MAXD / MIND).
$ Each sheet: LC MAXD in red AND LC MIND in blue, labels only where |value| > threshold (SCH2 MIN1/MAX1).
+PROG WING urs:1
HEAD 26016 v20 ULS envelopes
DB 1 TITL '26016_env_v20.cdb'
$ ---- P00 key picture: beam groups
SIZE TYPE 9 W 25.5 H 30 FORM URS SC 0 MARG NO
SCHH H1 0.35 H5 0 H6 0.33 H10 0.35 REVI EXTR TREV AMAX ND 1
VIEW TYPE DIRE X 1 Y 1.4 Z -0.8 AXIS NEGZ
GRP 11,12,13,14,15,21,23,24,25,31,35,60,61,62
STRU NUME GRP NUMN BEAM FILL VARC
$ ---- P01 L1_My: Level 1 framing (group 15) My, scale 1 cm = 50 kNm, labels |value| > 39 kNm
SIZE TYPE 9 W 25.5 H 30 FORM URS SC 0 MARG NO
SEL
SCHH H1 0.35 H5 0 H6 0.375 H10 0.35 REVI EXTR TREV AMAX ND 1
VIEW TYPE DIRE X 1 Y 1.4 Z -2.6 AXIS NEGZ
GRP 15
COLO C12 9001 C4 9001
SCH2 MIN1 39 MAX1 -39
LC 4329 TITL 'My kNm: max red/min blue' ; COLO C13 2101 C14 2101 ; BEAM TYPE MY UNIT 50 STAT MAX
AND
LC 4330 ; COLO C13 4101 C14 4101 ; BEAM TYPE MY UNIT 50 STAT MAX
$ ---- P02 L1_Vz: Level 1 framing (group 15) Vz, scale 1 cm = 50 kN, labels |value| > 34 kN
SIZE TYPE 9 W 25.5 H 30 FORM URS SC 0 MARG NO
